d":1599268,"name":"Michael Glantschnig","role":"Benjamin","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ybLCqZPPzDuRhBe28Xb2b9HuEGx.jpg"},{"id":2426801,"name":"Elisabeth Kanettis","role":"Lise","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fFLATpZzsv8KUqmXjWcWjrNqsFB.jpg"},{"id":2224602,"name":"Philip Mur","role":"Eberhard","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9oa1HAcm5UnYSVw2qvkuNxJ4I6H.jpg"},{"id":67010,"name":"Branko Samarovski","role":"Abt Daniel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3xUeNSOsi0vswpjIEqHxgJH0ysV.jpg"},{"id":2507078,"name":"Iva Šindelková","role":"Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4jLLoaIsza5Hc4Fi3nSPRs3N0mV.jpg"},{"id":1249262,"name":"Marius Theobald","role":"Alfred"},{"id":3397842,"name":"Johana Vašková","role":"Dancer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v22cJJs5H78EVa7QldzEcSPqF2w.jpg"},{"id":1412682,"name":"Susanna Wiegand","role":"Bauernmagd"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Narciso e Boccadoro","overview":"Nell'oscuro Medioevo, il giovane indisciplinato Boccadoro viene mandato in un monastero da suo padre per espiare anche i peccati di sua madre, che li ha abbandonati. Qui, Boccadoro fa la conoscenza di Narciso, un brillante ed erudito novizio dall'indole introversa e distaccata. Tra i due ben presto si pongono le basi per un'amicizia profonda e unica."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Narcissus and Goldmund","overview":"In the dark middle ages, young unruly Goldmund is sent to a monastery by his father to atone for the sins of his mother, who abandoned them. There, he meets Narcissus, a brilliant, scholarly novice who is introverted and aloof. A unique and deep life-long friendship is born. Narcissus chooses to remain detached from the world in prayer and meditation. Goldmund, passionate, sensual and impulsive, runs away from the monastery to live a picaresque wanderer’s life, his amorous and artistic adventures leading him to discover the extremes of both ecstasy and pain. Several thrilling years pass until one day these friends cross paths again..."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Der junge Goldmund wird von seinem Vater zum Studium ins Kloster Mariabronn geschickt und trifft dort auf den frommen Klosterschüler Narziss. Narziss hat sich dem asketischen und von strengen Regeln geprägten Leben im Kloster mit Herz und Seele verschrieben und zunächst versucht Goldmund, es ihm nachzutun. Zwischen den beiden entwickelt sich schon bald eine innige Freundschaft, aber der ungestüme und lebenslustige Goldmund erkennt bald, dass die Lebensperspektive, die ihm das Kloster bietet, nicht mit seinen Vorstellungen von Freiheit übereinstimmt und begibt sich, bestärkt von Narziss, auf eine Reise voller Abenteuer, bei der er schließlich auch seine große Liebe Lene kennenlernt. Doch Jahre später treffen sich Narziss und Goldmund unter dramatischen Umständen wieder ..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bF1VSmIW6en9bFT5uUCL4LE3FRk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fcDH5hBxWqnDXSdvWOPTvzdbg5g.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":644852,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bF1VSmIW6en9bFT5uUCL4LE3FRk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bF1VSmIW6en9bFT5uUCL4LE3FRk.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2135},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bF1VSmIW6en9bFT5uUCL4LE3FRk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bF1VSmIW6en9bFT5uUCL4LE3FRk.jpg","language":"it","width":1500,"height":2135}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jPQjMwhoHDdKfbGNOb4ilMWm6l2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jPQjMw